SUMMARY:Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart (July 16th) 
DESCRIPTION:Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart!\nHello everyone\,\n
 \nPlease join us for an inspiring and soulful experience with **Songs with
  Heart!**\n\nSongs about people\, love\, romance\, loss\, nature\, the fut
 ure\, the past\, the present\, spirituality and the search for meaning in 
 life :)\n\nCheck out one or more of my songs here too :)\nhttps://youtu.be
 /vei1PDucWoM?si=fHuM7nH3qBaDzi5c\n\nDo you appreciate?\n\n* Thoughtful son
 gwriting\n* Folk music\, country and soft rock storytelling\n* Life reflec
 tion and meaningful lyrics\n* Songs that help you understand yourself bett
 er\n\nIf so\, you have come to the right place :)\n\nThese are songs about
  ordinary people\, extraordinary moments\, beautiful imagery\, and the sea
 rch for what is real.\n\n\\*You are welcome to join us any time starting a
 t 9:00 pm (Eastern Time)\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve F
 lemming\n(Canadian Folk and Country Artist)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@Stev
 eFlemmingSongs\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with He
 art (Thursday\, July 16th)**\n**(on Zoom)**\n\nSteve Flemming's songs expl
 ore the human experience through storytelling\, reflection\, imagination\,
  and heartfelt observation. Drawing from folk\, country\, rock\, blue eyed
  soul\, and singer-songwriter traditions\, his work touches on themes of l
 ove\, loss\, hope\, resilience\, freedom\, social awareness\, personal gro
 wth\, spirituality\, and the search for meaning. His songs often feature m
 emorable characters\, everyday moments\, philosophical questions\, and a d
 eep curiosity about life and human nature. Whether telling a story\, shari
 ng a life lesson\, expressing a romantic sentiment\, or reflecting on the 
 state of the world\, his music seeks to inspire thought\, connection\, com
 passion\, and a greater appreciation for the journey we all share\n\n**Son
 gs containing:**\n\n* Memorable characters\n* Emotional honesty\n* Genuine
  craftsmanship\n\n**Who is Steve Flemming?**\nSteve Flemming is a prolific
  folk-country songwriter\; whose songs explore ordinary people\, gratitude
 \, personal reflection\, nature\, spirituality\, and the search for meanin
 g.\n\n**A little more about Steve the songwriter:**\nHis songs explore fre
 edom\, awareness\, love\, consciousness\, and the simple wisdom hidden in 
 ordinary life.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n\n**Pay What You
  Can: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send through e transfer or pay pal to:\n
 **steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything you can contribute is greatly a
 ppreciated to help support these wonderful intimate evenings among music l
 overs and friends\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928\
 n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
