 ,\n\nPlease join us for a great day as we mix\, mingle and enjoy **the Wor
 ld Cup Final Game!**\n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we ca
 n anticipate a fabulous turn out with lots of friendly peers to enjoy the 
 big game with!\n\n**\\*Meet us inside Smoke Show between 2:00 pm and 3:00 
 pm**\n\\*Includes Mix\, Mingle and Board games at 1:00 pm and Patio Dinner
  Party after the Soccer game at 5:30 pm :)\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSin
 cerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**2026 FIF
 A World Cup Final Game Party! (with Food and Drink Specials) (Sunday\, Jul
 y 19th)**\n\n-A fun\, interactive\, event with friends\, food and the Worl
 d Cup Finals Party!\n-Amazing people\, resereved seating\, great food and 
